    "steam_appid": 2827690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/184d847549dee7f76d00e2da72047097.avif?t=1733806810\" width=600 height=83 /></span><br><br>Dive into &quot;The Carnival of Company,&quot; an action-adventure game blending rogue-like and RPG elements. Play as Jack Navarro, who stumbles upon his employer N-AGM Corporation's dark pact with demons to summon the &quot;Eternal Carnival.&quot; Betrayed and sent to the demon realm by his lover Angela, Jack vows revenge.<br><br>With the unique &quot;Path of Carnival&quot; system, enhance Jack's abilities by consuming demon organs and brains to transform and gain new powers. Battle through the demon realm, uncover its secrets, and thwart the corporation's dark agenda.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/a3c83de726c63592b903bd1205ec65da.poster.avif?t=1733806810\" width=640 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/a3c83de726c63592b903bd1205ec65da.webm?t=1733806810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/a3c83de726c63592b903bd1205ec65da.mp4?t=1733806810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into the dark and thrilling world of &quot;The Carnival of Company&quot; with features that blend the grotesque with the strategic, creating a truly unique gaming experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/07d32b96293e355a9cfb6b88f1271657.avif?t=1733806810\" width=600 height=83 /></span><br><br><strong>Organ Consumption:</strong> Feast on the organs of your fallen enemies to bolster specific attributes of your character. Each organ consumed enhances your strength, agility, or magic in ways unique to the creature it came from, offering a deep layer of strategy to character development.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/cc76621c32eef291fcc7ea4344367d56.poster.avif?t=1733806810\" width=640 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/cc76621c32eef291fcc7ea4344367d56.webm?t=1733806810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/cc76621c32eef291fcc7ea4344367d56.mp4?t=1733806810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Brain Consumption:</strong> Seize the brains of your adversaries to temporarily transform into their forms and gain access to their powers. This not only provides a tactical advantage but also allows for a rich variety of gameplay styles and approaches to combat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/bfe080856b46321eb52dc0feeb38dfcf.poster.avif?t=1733806810\" width=640 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/bfe080856b46321eb52dc0feeb38dfcf.webm?t=1733806810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/bfe080856b46321eb52dc0feeb38dfcf.mp4?t=1733806810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Permadeath and Permatorture:</strong> Brace yourself for the rising specter of permadeath, a looming threat that intensifies with each battle. Fear not defeat, for if luck is on your side, you might escape with mere &quot;permatorture&quot; - a state leaving you with lasting damage but alive to fight another day.<br><br><strong>Path of Carnival:</strong> Enhance your combat with fire, ice, electricity, or poison elemental damage. Select passive skills to improve parrying, mobility, and more, allowing for extensive customization and a unique gameplay experience for each player.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/6d90d004380456f1376128eb6806f475.poster.avif?t=1733806810\" width=640 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/6d90d004380456f1376128eb6806f475.webm?t=1733806810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/6d90d004380456f1376128eb6806f475.mp4?t=1733806810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;The Carnival of Company&quot; draws players into an adventure filled with death and discovery. In this dark realm, survival depends on consuming the essence of your enemies to grow stronger and strategizing your path of vengeance.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/184d847549dee7f76d00e2da72047097.avif?t=1733806810\" width=600 height=83 /></span><br><br>Dive into &quot;The Carnival of Company,&quot; an action-adventure game blending rogue-like and RPG elements. Play as Jack Navarro, who stumbles upon his employer N-AGM Corporation's dark pact with demons to summon the &quot;Eternal Carnival.&quot; Betrayed and sent to the demon realm by his lover Angela, Jack vows revenge.<br><br>With the unique &quot;Path of Carnival&quot; system, enhance Jack's abilities by consuming demon organs and brains to transform and gain new powers. Battle through the demon realm, uncover its secrets, and thwart the corporation's dark agenda.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/a3c83de726c63592b903bd1205ec65da.poster.avif?t=1733806810\" width=640 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/a3c83de726c63592b903bd1205ec65da.webm?t=1733806810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/a3c83de726c63592b903bd1205ec65da.mp4?t=1733806810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into the dark and thrilling world of &quot;The Carnival of Company&quot; with features that blend the grotesque with the strategic, creating a truly unique gaming experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/07d32b96293e355a9cfb6b88f1271657.avif?t=1733806810\" width=600 height=83 /></span><br><br><strong>Organ Consumption:</strong> Feast on the organs of your fallen enemies to bolster specific attributes of your charact