e but alive to fight another day.<br><br><strong>Path of Carnival:</strong> Enhance your combat with fire, ice, electricity, or poison elemental damage. Select passive skills to improve parrying, mobility, and more, allowing for extensive customization and a unique gameplay experience for each player.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/6d90d004380456f1376128eb6806f475.poster.avif?t=1733806810\" width=640 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/6d90d004380456f1376128eb6806f475.webm?t=1733806810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827690/extras/6d90d004380456f1376128eb6806f475.mp4?t=1733806810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;The Carnival of Company&quot; draws players into an adventure filled with death and discovery. In this dark realm, survival depends on consuming the essence of your enemies to grow stronger and strategizing your path of vengeance.",
